 \u0026 anaerobic fitness\", \"Rotational core strength\", \"Precision hand-eye control\"],\n        \"arrangements\": \"Hard-court rankings matches, weekend grand-slam format tournaments, and ball-machine training sessions.\"\n    }\n}"}]}
